        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We are unable to update this game, so in-game logos and credits may be inaccurate and not up to date.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724310/extras/efd485139100fbd21e9b9c1dd6b7059a.avif?t=1787676176\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724310/extras_big/efd485139100fbd21e9b9c1dd6b7059a.webp?t=1787676176 width=1560 height=481 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE FINAL CHAPTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirteen years have passed since the events of <i>Playtown</i> and <i>Playtown 2</i>. The once-abandoned indoor playground has mysteriously reopened, and something sinister lurks beneath the surface. Determined to put an end to the enigmatic <strong>E.Y.E. Order</strong>, the protagonist infiltrates Playtown and soon realizes their suspicions were right. What was once a playground is now a front for something far more disturbing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENCOUNTER NEW FACES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second wave of mascot creation has begun. As you explore the eerie new Playtown facility, it becomes clear that the scientists have taken things even further. They have designed new creatures, blending familiar mascot designs with <strong>horrifying mutations</strong>. Their purpose is to guard the hidden entrances to the E.Y.E. Order, ensuring no intruder gets close to the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOP HEXCOR BEFORE IT’S TOO LATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifying reality unfolds. Playtown is just the beginning. The E.Y.E. Order has expanded beneath <strong>California</strong>, with countless hidden facilities fueling their twisted experiments. At the center of it all is Hexcor, their leader, their mastermind, their god. He has set something catastrophic in motion, and if you don’t act fast, the consequences could be <strong>irreversible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth. Survive the horrors. End the Order.</p>",
